        "created_at": "2025-03-09T20:05:33.221Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I often wonder if there is not some nefarious point to the rash of “EvE Sucks/is Dying” posts lately…</p>\n<p>In game most folks I run into seem fairly positive about the game…it’s crazy the amount of folks who just want to Fleet up lately</p>\n<p>The most vocal haters seem to be the Frontier Blockchain bros…go figure. <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/neutral_face.png?v=13\" title=\":neutral_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":neutral_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
